/fr-originals/output":"1948-04-01","later-events_catalog":"1948-04-01","stage19_causal_queue":"1948-04-01"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:9942","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"tain Functions  U nder the Rubber A ct \nof 1948\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me \nby the Rubber Act of 1948, approved \nMarch 31, 1948, and as President of the \nUnited States, it is hereby ordered, in \nthe interest of the internal, management \nof the Government, as follows:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"13 FR 1823, PDF pages 1-1; operative words before the numbered sections","sha256":"ba1f80c687c2a4b5c180edc490bc525e5f22a128cc0760004fca4c5e2b2ecc03","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-04-03/pdf/FR-1948-04-03.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:9942#preamble-op","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"1. The Secretary of Commerce shall \nperform and exercise the functions, \nduties, powers, authority, and discretion \n(hereinafter collectively referred to as \nfunctions) vested in the President by \nsections 3, 4, 18 (c ), and 18 (d) of thfe \nRubber Act of 1948.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"13 FR 1823, PDF pages 1-1; para. 1","sha256":"ba1f80c687c2a4b5c180edc490bc525e5f22a128cc0760004fca4c5e2b2ecc03","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-04-03/pdf/FR-1948-04-03.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:9942#para1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"2. The Reconstruction Finance Corpo­\nration shall perform and exercise the \nfunctions vested in the President by, or \ndesignated in, sections 5 (c ), 5 (e ), 6,7,8, \n11 (a), and 18 (f) of the Rubber Act of \n1948: Provided, That the provisions of \nthis paragraph which relate to section \n6 (a) of the said Act shall not be con­\nstrued as precluding any other agency of \nthe Government from engaging in re­\nsearch or development authorized by law.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"13 FR 1823, PDF pages 1-1; para. 2","sha256":"ba1f80c687c2a4b5c180edc490bc525e5f22a128cc0760004fca4c5e2b2ecc03","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-04-03/pdf/FR-1948-04-03.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:9942#para2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"3. The Secretary of Commerce shall \nin respect of the functions covered by \nparagraph 1 of this order and related \nfunctions under the Rubber Act of 1948, \nand the Reconstruction Finance Corpo­\nration shall in respect of the functions \ncovered by paragraph 2 of this order and \nrelated functions under said Act, perform \nand exercise the functions of the Presi­\ndent (including the power of subpena) \nunder sections 10 and 12 of the said Act.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"13 FR 1823, PDF pages 1-1; para. 3","sha256":"ba1f80c687c2a4b5c180edc490bc525e5f22a128cc0760004fca4c5e2b2ecc03","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-04-03/pdf/FR-1948-04-03.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:9942#para3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"4. This order shall be effective April 1,\n1948. _","original_source":{"page_or_item":"13 FR 1823, PDF pages 1-1; para. 4","sha256":"ba1f80c687c2a4b5c180edc490bc525e5f22a128cc0760004fca4c5e2b2ecc03","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-04-03/pdf/FR-1948-04-03.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:9942#para4","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"13 FR 1823, PDF pages 1-1","sha256":"ba1f80c687c2a4b5c180edc490bc525e5f22a128cc0760004fca4c5e2b2ecc03","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-04-03/pdf/FR-1948-04-03.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema"